WEBVTT

00:05:58.979 --> 00:06:00.856
to those who are most at risk?

00:06:00.898 --> 00:06:02.108
At the same time,

00:06:02.108 --> 00:06:05.319
why are we not actually driving
transmission down where we can?

00:06:05.361 --> 00:06:07.196
And I don't mean lockdown.

00:06:07.238 --> 00:06:11.659
This idea that we have to either be
completely open or completely closed

00:06:11.700 --> 00:06:13.369
is frankly rubbish.

00:06:13.411 --> 00:06:15.663
We have masks, we have distancing,

00:06:15.704 --> 00:06:19.417
we have efforts to improve ventilation
where we live, where we work,

00:06:19.417 --> 00:06:20.835
where we study.

00:06:20.876 --> 00:06:22.670
We know we can avoid crowds.

00:06:22.711 --> 00:06:25.589
Why aren't we doing that
right now, not forever?

00:06:25.631 --> 00:06:27.842
We're not going to be
in this pandemic forever.

00:06:27.883 --> 00:06:29.093
It will end.

00:06:29.135 --> 00:06:31.345
That is something
that I can say for certain,